    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add chicken, salt to taste, ginger garlic paste, curd, white pepper powder and marinate it well.",
      "Rest it for 15-20 minutes and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add white onions, salt to taste and oil.",
      "Transfer it to a grinder jar and make a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add poppy seeds and cashews.",
      "Transfer it to a grinder jar and make a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a handi or kadai, add oil, ghee, once it's hot, add cloves, bay leaf, cinnamon stick, dry red chillies and let it splutter.",
      "Add butter, prepared onion paste and sautÃ© for a minute.",
      "Add curd, marinated chicken and mix it well.",
      "Cover it with the lid and cook it for a while or until the chicken is tender.",
      "Add saffron strands, kewra water, prepared cashew & poppy seeds paste and mix it well.",
      "Let it simmer for a while and finish it with the prepared masala.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and sprinkle it with some prepared masala.",
      "Garnish it with coriander sprig and serve hot with lachha paratha.",
      "In a bowl, add black peppercorns, green cardamom, mace, coriander seeds and salt to taste.",
      "Transfer it to a grinder jar and make a fine powder.",
      "Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
